      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LEFT TILL LAST (2) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing third behind Swift Eddy (23.61) in a Maiden. Settled off speed and worked to the line nicely. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Good form should continue. HUXLEY'S ROCKET (1) is yet to break through in seven starts but has run a number of placings. Was in the placings again last time finishing second (23.26) at this track. Expected to be in this for a long way. XANADU GUNN (8) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (23.26) in a Maiden at Gosford. Likely to play a prominent role. STARIA CARGO (3) was unplaced here last start but gets her chance to atone.",
